msgctxt "80"
msgid "Come by any time you like!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Hey, Okuda. Think I'm gonna need to train again, if you\r\n"
"don't mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Oh, no problem at all! Construction's not slated to start,\r\n"
"well, technically ever, so we're in the clear! I'm sure the boss'll be "
"thrilled to lend you a hand, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I have to say, I never thought Mack's friend would end up\r\n"
"being a Majima Family henchman. You two make an interesting pair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "You'd be surprised how often we hear that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Wanna know how we first met? It was at a smoky bar in a back alley in "
"Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"I'd been arguing with the old ball and chain back home, so I\r\n"
"was sulking hard. Went the only place I knew I could get\r\n"
"some peace and quiet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"But then some guy started going off about a foreigner who\r\n"
"spilled a drink on him. Clearly this asshole was just trying\r\n"
"to pick a fight with the out-of-towner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"I dunno if it was my mood or 'cause it was my turf, but I felt obligated to "
"help the poor foreigner out. And as you might've guessed, that foreigner "
"was Mack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"We got to talking right after, and he spent the rest of the\r\n"
"night regaling me with tall tales of all the places around\r\n"
"the world he's gone searching for the perfect shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"I guess we just hit it off, you know? Makes sense, too.\r\n"
"I've got a pretty big travel bug myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "That's incredible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Long story short, we always get together and toss a few back\r\n"
"when Mack's in town. And now I'm gonna do whatever it takes\r\n"
"to help him get that shot he's been after all these years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Anyway, feel free to come by whenever you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Thanks, Okuda."
msgstr ""

